  "body": "View by appointment only.\r\n\r\nDiscover the perfect balance of independence, comfort, and financial peace of mind in this beautifully renovated freehold home at Puriri Park, Takapuna.\r\nUnlike traditional retirement villages that lock you in with high exit fees, this freehold property lets you retain full ownership and all future capital gain. Enjoy a low-maintenance lifestyle without sacrificing quality or freedom. Just 5 minutes to North Shore Hospital and only 6 minutes to the golden sands of Takapuna Beach, this home offers the very best of coastal village living with excellent healthcare right on your doorstep.\r\n \r\nThis home has been completely upgraded to a high standard with your long-term comfort in mind. It features a premium kitchen with AEG appliances, induction cooking, and a silent German ceiling-mounted extractor. The oven and dish drawer have never been used and are essentially brand new. You will also enjoy beautiful oak flooring throughout for warmth and elegance, year-round comfort with full double glazing, ceiling and underfloor insulation, plus underfloor heating in the bathroom. The fully accessible bathroom includes a level-entry shower with integrated seating and a raised toilet. A delightful fully enclosed double-glazed sunroom at the back of the unit gets afternoon sun, while the north-facing front entrance has a low maintenance garden with a sheltered patio area that gets full morning sun. \r\n\r\nEverything has been designed for easy, safe, and enjoyable living – perfect for enjoying your retirement years to the fullest.\r\n\r\nProperties offering this rare combination of independence, quality, modern comfort, and strong financial clarity in central Takapuna rarely come to market. Secure your slice of Takapuna’s best lifestyle today. Come along to an open home or contact Jennie or Vinnie to organise a private viewing of this exceptional freehold home at Puriri Park.",
